+ *
+ * Hand-written SIMD128 kernels, bit-identical to the scalar C paths by
+ * construction.  They coexist with the Arm/Neon kernels translated by
+ * WITH_SIMDE: where a wasm kernel exists it is preferred, and every other
+ * kernel still comes from the translated set, so coverage is never reduced.
+ *
